msgstr "Prepare caller storage for OUT DATA requiring explicit approval."

msgid "Task-only. Accepted bytes remain borrowed through STATUS or actual drain. DATA_READY grants only the documented const inspection view."
msgstr "Task-only. Accepted bytes remain borrowed through STATUS or actual drain. DATA_READY grants only the documented const inspection view."

